{"id":842304,"title":"15｜设计网站功能和页面图纸","content":"本节课通过COSER工具规划并设计了一个常用工具网站。首先，利用自动补全功能进行头脑风暴，确定了网站的核心功能：文件转换、图片压缩、裁剪、格式转换及水印处理。接着，明确了简洁大方的界面需求和明显的导航菜单位置。随后，使用COSER生成了包含这些功能的线框图示意图，并调整提示词确保每个功能有独立页面且示意图单独写入文件中。最后，基于功能规划与网页示意图，COSER生成了项目代码架构设计文档，包括前端React技术栈、后端Node.js及其第三方库的选择，以及前后端交互采用RESTful API方式。此外，还考虑了安全性（如文件大小限制、类型检查）和性能优化措施。整个过程展示了如何高效利用自动化工具辅助网站开发从概念到架构设计的全过程。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397219,"user_name":"西西弗与卡夫卡","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1001710,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"B4C27B8335B76A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/48/ee/96a7d638.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1737313643,"is_pvip":true,"replies":[{"id":144125,"content":"同学说的很对，还有其它工具如copycoder也可以，咱们这个课主要讲cursor，所以没有延伸到其它工具哈","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1737343088,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":397219,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"页面设计可以用 MasterGo 这类设计工具，也有 AI 能力。然后将设计页面的截图或者导出的页面代码给到 Cursor，让它按照此风格生成前端代码","like_count":3,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":656314,"discussion_content":"同学说的很对，还有其它工具如copycoder也可以，咱们这个课主要讲cursor，所以没有延伸到其它工具哈","content_length":54,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1737343088,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397683,"user_name":"勇往直前","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3685918,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"6177BDF403ECC0","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/38/3e/1e/fe4d81df.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1739324915,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144287,"content":"可以使用composer对话框历史里的restore按钮将代码恢复到某个版本。如果是修改后再让它删除某些内容，可能没那么好用。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1739361900,"ip_address":"河北","comment_id":397683,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"郭老师，使用composer时遇到一个问题，请教下怎么解决，比如：让cursor生成一个java项目，它选择使用了Spring Security做权限管理，我让它重新更换为shiro后， Spring Security相关的代码文件不会自动删除，但pom中的依赖会被移除，导致项目爆红，怎么能够让他替换后，把不相关的代码文件自动也删除掉呢","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":657104,"discussion_content":"可以使用composer对话框历史里的restore按钮将代码恢复到某个版本。如果是修改后再让它删除某些内容，可能没那么好用。","content_length":63,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1739361900,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"河北","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397669,"user_name":"林家振","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1030148,"ip_address":"福建","ucode":"33DEC8476ED5E6","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/04/6b55351e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1739264271,"is_pvip":true,"replies":[{"id":144283,"content":"同学你好，这个情况需要找到具体是什么内容导致写入文件时发生了分割，然后用提示词将影响写入的文件单独写入到独立文件中。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1739270239,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":397669,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"郭总您好，cursor生成文件的时候经常有内容不包含在文件中，就像视频中网站页面设计示意图的首页布局下面的内容在框框外面，这种情况怎么办？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":657021,"discussion_content":"同学你好，这个情况需要找到具体是什么内容导致写入文件时发生了分割，然后用提示词将影响写入的文件单独写入到独立文件中。","content_length":58,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1739270239,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":398375,"user_name":"hola","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2714488,"ip_address":"湖北","ucode":"9B0D1B43CB778F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/29/6b/78/9300ba89.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1741144151,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"准备用 github copilot 来做实战部分的练习","like_count":2}]}